    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19868" root="سعو and سعى" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَعْوَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِعْوٌ</span>, in two places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>i. q.</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَمْعَةٌ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَمَعَةٌ</span> [i. e. <i>A piece of wax,</i> or <i>a candle</i>]:
(IAar, TA:) in the K, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السمعة</span> is erroneously put
for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشمعة</span>: [so in the TA; but it is omitted in
the CK and in my MS. copy of the K:] pl. [or
rather coll. gen. n.] ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَعْوٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

